  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees Fahrenheit",
    "Soak the cedar plank in water for 30 minutes",
    "In a large bowl, mix together the brown rice, dried shrimp, olive oil, onion, garlic, salt, and black pepper",
    "Place the mixture onto the cedar plank",
    "Bake the pilaf in the preheated oven for 25 minutes",
    "Remove the pilaf from the oven and let it cool for 5 minutes",
    "Serve the pilaf hot and enjoy"
